  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "generated" ] ;
     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap jp-bodymeasurement-to-loinc</b></p><a name=\"jp-bodymeasurement-to-loinc\"> </a><a name=\"hcjp-bodymeasurement-to-loinc\"> </a><p>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-jp-observation-bodymeasurement-code-cs.html\">http://jpfhir.jp/fhir/core/CodeSystem/JP_ObservationBodyMeasurementCode_CS</a> to <a href=\"https://simplifier.net/resolve?scope=jpfhir-terminology@1.4.0&amp;canonical=http://loinc.org\">http://loinc.org</a></p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-jp-observation-bodymeasurement-code-cs.html\">JP Core Observation BodyMeasurement Code CodeSystemversion: 1.3.0-dev)</a> to <a href=\"https://simplifier.net/resolve?scope=jpfhir-terminology@1.4.0&amp;canonical=http://loinc.org\">Loinc CodeSystem PART file + Core Table Japanese Modification</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>31000296 (体重(Kg))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>29463-7 (Body weight)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>31000297 (体重(g))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>29463-7 (Body weight)</td><td>単位は g だが体重という概念は同一。LOINC 29463-7 で UCUM単位 g を指定して表現する。</td></tr><tr><td>31000298 (身長)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>8302-2 (Body height)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>31000299 (胸囲)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>9561-3 (Chest circumference at xiphoid process)</td><td>LOINCの概念は胸骨剣状突起レベルを指定しているが、JP側はレベル未指定。</td></tr><tr><td>31000300 (腹囲（臍上）)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>8280-0 (Waist Circumference at umbilicus [Length] by Tape measure)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>31000301 (腹囲)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>56115-9 (Waist Circumference by Tape measure)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>31001697 (体脂肪率)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>41982-0 (Percentage of body fat Measured)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>31002900 (出生体重)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>8339-4 (Birth weight Measured)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>31003020 (ＢＭＩ)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>39156-5 (Body mass index (BMI) [Ratio])</td><td/></tr><tr><td>31003138 (標準体重)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td>59574-4 (Body weight special circumstances)</td><td>LOINCに標準体重（理想体重）の直接対応コードがないため暫定。</td></tr><tr><td>31003421 (上腕周囲長（ＡＣ）)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>56072-2 (Arm circumference)</td><td>LOINCは上腕の左右を区別しないため wider。</td></tr><tr><td>31003422 (下腿周囲長（ＣＣ）)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>56162-1 (Calf circumference)</td><td>LOINCは下腿の左右を区別しないため wider。</td></tr><tr><td>31006116 (頭囲)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>9843-4 (Head Occipital-frontal circumference by Tape measure)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>31006215 (握力（右）)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>62951-8 (Grip strength Hand - right Dynamometer)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>31006216 (握力（左）)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>62952-6 (Grip strength Hand - left Dynamometer)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>31003727 (体重変化量(Kg))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>79300-3 (Weight change [Mass])</td><td/></tr></table></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
